    int i;

    for (i = 0; i < size; i++) {
        printf("%s", array[i]);
        if (i < size - 1)
            printf(", ");       /* separator between two names */
    }
    printf("\n");
}
```

It needs `#include <stdio.h>`. For the 15 names of Table 1 in their initial order, `doDisplay(names, N)` prints (checked with a Python translation of the same loop):

